{"id":35994,"mal_id":35994,"title":"Satsuriku no Tenshi","englishTitle":"Angels of Death","title_english":"Angels of Death","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Angel of Massacre","Angel of Slaughter"],"en":"Angels of Death","ja":"殺戮の天使"},"synopsis":"With dead and lifeless eyes, Rachel Gardner wishes only to die. Waking up in the basement of a building, she has no idea how or why she's there. She stumbles across a bandaged murderer named Zack, who is trying to escape. After promising to kill her as soon as he is free, Rachel and Zack set out to ascend through the building floor by floor until they escape.\n\nHowever, as they progress upward, they meet more twisted people, and all of them seem familiar with Rachel. What is her connection to the building, and why was she placed in it? Facing a new boss on each floor, can Rachel and Zack both achieve their wishes?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Con ojos muertos y sin vida, Rachel Gardner sólo desea morir. Al despertarse en el sótano de un edificio, no tiene idea de cómo ni por qué está allí. Se topa con un asesino vendado llamado Zack, que intenta escapar. Después de prometer matarla tan pronto como esté libre, Rachel y Zack se propusieron ascender por el edificio piso por piso hasta escapar.\n\nSin embargo, a medida que avanzan, conocen a personas más retorcidas y todos parecen estar familiarizados con Rachel. ¿Cuál es su conexión con el edificio y por qué fue colocada en él? Al enfrentarse a un nuevo jefe en cada piso, ¿podrán Rachel y Zack lograr sus deseos?\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2018-07-06","start_date":"2018-07-06","endDate":"2018-10-26","end_date":"2018-10-26","season":"summer","year":2018,"start_season":{"year":2018,"season":"summer"},"episodes":16,"num_episodes":16,"score":6.97,"mean":6.97,"numListUsers":752372,"num_list_users":752372,"genres":[{"id":2,"na